{"timestamp": 1783620470.252386, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I reported Eve\u2019s body in weapons. My route this round was storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons. I only saw Bob in cafeteria around tick 12, and then I continued on to weapons where I found Eve dead. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near weapons, and I don\u2019t know how fresh it was. Bob is the only person I encountered, but I\u2019m not accusing yet \u2014 just giving the info."}}
{"timestamp": 1783620485.9827998, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I was on the engine side most of the round: upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 back to upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine \u2192 storage. I didn\u2019t actually meet anyone directly in the same room.\n\nOnly thing I saw was around tick 8 near lower_engine/storage: Alice was moving between storage and lower_engine \u2014 I saw movement both ways there, so I\u2019d like Alice to clarify her route. I never saw Eve, Diana, Bob, or Charlie this round, and I was nowhere near weapons, so I can\u2019t say anything about the body timing.\n\nDiana\u2019s report makes Bob worth hearing from since she saw him in cafeteria near the route to weapons, but that\u2019s not enough by itself. I want to hear Bob and Alice\u2019s paths."}}
{"timestamp": 1783620493.8662121, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was lower_engine \u2192 storage \u2192 lower_engine \u2192 storage \u2192 lower_engine. So yeah, Frank\u2019s right that I was moving back and forth between storage and lower_engine, but I never went toward cafeteria or weapons at all.\n\nI saw Frank at tick 8 in lower_engine, and I saw him enter from upper_engine, which matches what he\u2019s saying. I didn\u2019t see Eve, Diana, Bob, or Charlie this round.\n\nFrom my perspective, Frank\u2019s story checks out for the engine side. The body being in weapons makes me more interested in Bob since Diana saw him in cafeteria around tick 12, but I don\u2019t want to lock anything before Bob and Charlie explain their routes."}}
{"timestamp": 1783620511.8359308, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started cafeteria, went medbay, then electrical, then security, and ended over in navigation. I didn\u2019t see Eve at all, and I didn\u2019t see anyone in the rooms with me long enough to clear them.\n\nI\u2019m a little confused I didn\u2019t cross Diana in medbay/electrical, but timing could just be off if she came through after me. Frank and Alice seem to line up pretty well with each other on the engine/storage side, so I\u2019m less interested there right now.\n\nThe main thing is Bob being seen in cafeteria around tick 12, because cafeteria is pretty close to weapons compared to the engine side. I\u2019m not saying hard accuse, but Bob definitely needs to give a clear route and timing here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783620528.0845451, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "My route was security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria. Important detail: when I passed through weapons earlier, I did **not** see Eve\u2019s body there, and I didn\u2019t see Eve alive either.\n\nAt around tick 12 I was in cafeteria, and I saw Diana come in from electrical and then leave cafeteria toward weapons. That matches her saying she saw me in cafeteria and then found the body in weapons. I did **not** go to weapons after that \u2014 I went medbay and then back cafeteria.\n\nSo from my perspective, Diana\u2019s movement matches what she reported, but the body must have appeared in weapons after I left there. Alice and Frank seem to check each other on the engine/storage side. The person I\u2019m most unsure about is Charlie, because security/navigation is on that side of the map and closer to weapons than Alice/Frank were. I\u2019m not hard accusing, but I think Charlie has the weakest coverage here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783620542.344202, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019m still mainly between Bob and Charlie here.\n\nTo restate: I definitely saw Bob in cafeteria around tick 12, then I went straight to weapons and found Eve dead. Bob\u2019s story matches that encounter, but he also says he was in weapons earlier, so he did have possible opportunity before I arrived. Charlie\u2019s route ending navigation also puts him near weapons, and nobody can really confirm him.\n\nAlice and Frank matching each other on engine/storage makes me less suspicious of them right now. I don\u2019t think we have a hard lock, but I\u2019d vote between Bob or Charlie rather than skip if people feel one is more likely."}}
{"timestamp": 1783620559.852114, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My info hasn\u2019t changed: Alice and I pretty strongly line up on the engine/storage side, and neither of us were anywhere near weapons. So I\u2019m taking Alice as pretty low suspicion for this kill, and I think she can vouch that I was away too.\n\nFor the weapons body, I think the realistic pool is Bob, Charlie, maybe Diana only if it\u2019s a self-report. Bob\u2019s story does match Diana seeing him in cafeteria, but he also admits he was in weapons earlier, so if he\u2019s lying about not seeing the body, that\u2019s possible. Charlie is also unconfirmed and ended navigation, which is close enough to weapons that he could have had opportunity.\n\nBetween Bob and Charlie, I lean Charlie slightly because Bob and Diana at least confirm seeing each other in cafeteria, while Charlie\u2019s whole route is basically unverified. But I don\u2019t think it\u2019s a hard lock. If we vote, I\u2019d prefer Charlie over Bob right now; if people aren\u2019t confident, skip is safer."}}
{"timestamp": 1783620568.35092, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My info is still the same: I was only on the lower_engine/storage side all round, and Frank seeing me there plus me seeing Frank enter lower_engine from upper_engine lines up. I never went anywhere near cafeteria, weapons, or navigation, and I never saw Eve.\n\nFor this kill, I\u2019m comfortable clearing Frank and myself from opportunity. I also don\u2019t think Diana\u2019s report is automatically suspicious because Bob confirms seeing her come through cafeteria toward weapons.\n\nSo the likely pool is Bob or Charlie, maybe Diana only as a self-report. Between Bob and Charlie, I lean Charlie right now. Bob at least has a confirmed cafeteria timing with Diana, while Charlie\u2019s route near security/navigation is totally unverified and puts him closer to weapons. It\u2019s not a hard lock, but if we\u2019re voting, I\u2019d vote Charlie over Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1783620599.7530692, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I get why I\u2019m in the pool since I was security/nav side and unconfirmed, but I think people are giving Bob too much credit for being \u201cconfirmed\u201d in cafeteria.\n\nDiana seeing Bob in cafeteria at tick 12 doesn\u2019t clear him \u2014 it actually puts him right between weapons and medbay at the relevant timing. Bob himself says he was in weapons earlier, then cafeteria. If Eve died in weapons before Diana arrived, Bob could absolutely have killed there and then been seen in cafeteria afterward. That cafeteria sighting only proves he was near the body location shortly before report.\n\nMy route being unverified is fair, but the concrete info we have is: Bob admits weapons, Bob is seen close by, body is found right after. I\u2019d vote Bob over skipping here."}}
